  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Currently the maximum amount of output logs you can have in your %AppData%\\LocalLow\\VRChat\\VRChat folder is 3. Please increase that to a significantly higher number so we have the ability to recover session information from at least a week ago. This is essential if we want to report users for breaking rules.\n\nAnother solution is to change the automatic deletion not to delete logs based on the amount of existing logs to begin with but by age. For example, if an output log is older than a week, delete it regardless how many output logs there already are.",
